8Aoc8Nr?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hotatenshi333/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9af92415/uploads/origins/6549b8a1-26c7-491f-af5f-82405bd93fc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=218877c9b17af7635af01925a3754d09", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9af92415/uploads/origins/6549b8a1-26c7-491f-af5f-82405bd93fc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=218877c9b17af7635af01925a3754d09, https://si.imgix.net/9af92415/uploads/origins/6549b8a1-26c7-491f-af5f-82405bd93fc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7029e2e9275b27ac21d91465f6410712 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9af92415/uploads/origins/6549b8a1-26c7-491f-af5f-82405bd93fc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc44ff090ee4d0b2ae12a330f6a0937c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ほたてんし様\n\nskeb開設ありがとうございます!\n\n依頼について:\n\nhttps://cnotion.notion.site/Daryl-Mio-3c03d80a2429444893dba9839031c0be\n\n女の子がカフェで誰かを待ってるシチュエーション。大きなガラス窓を見ながら何かを考えている表情。外は雨。\n\n他はお任せします!\n\nご検討いただければ幸いです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}